# Doppelgang (X = 2) targets Bot2's Isamaru, Hound of Konda (legendary) and an Ornithopter. The two Isamaru tokens are copies, so they are legendary too (CR 707.2) and Bot1 controls both: the legend rule
# (CR 704.5j) makes Bot1 keep one and put the other into the graveyard, where a token ceases to exist (CR 704.5d, 111.7). Bot2's own Isamaru is a different controller's and is not affected (it is only about
# permanents one player controls). Two Ornithopter tokens and one Isamaru token remain for Bot1.

